{"server":"tw","storyId":"act5d0_level_act5d0_09_end","groupId":"act5d0","stageId":"act5d0_09","title":"0:01A.M.","storyCode":"CB-9","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_09_end.txt","sourceHash":"9895d0eb83b21d3b7a02ec2508b1e26013a95b07a8acc0572ba272bf0c96afaf","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"槐琥二人與企鵝物流一行在露天派對相遇，出於發洩目的，槐琥與德克薩斯打成一團。大帝的演出正值高潮，卻突然被鼠王刺穿了身體。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"0:38 P.M.    天氣/沙塵\n龍門市區，廣場，露天派對"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我們跟著指示過來了，但為什麼......是個露天派對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"看到那個蠟燭了沒！好大！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"能天使，安靜一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"空氣裡甜味太重了，稍微有點不舒服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......要是下次在這裡申請一個攤位的話，應該會大賺的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯，老闆有消息嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"暫時沒有，也許他就在哪裡酩酊大醉吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......能天使，把我頭上的東西摘下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是因為這盞日光燈，根本沒有辦法戴這種高高的派對帽喔？我很羡慕的喔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"那如果強行戴上會怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"就像是宿醉醒來的時候發現自己在德克薩斯的副駕駛上高歌猛進的感覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"......那真是不得了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"你還真的這麼試過啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，老闆在哪兒呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡人太多了，如果敵人追到了這裡，會把普通人都捲進去的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"......是你們，企鵝物流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得你是......那個偵探所的打工妹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"旁邊這位就是傳聞中一人一刀走碼頭的分舵主？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，呃，怎麼還有這麼誇張的版本......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是個普通的小商販，啊，今晚還兼職魚丸師傅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是德克薩斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"今天晚上發生的事情，你們可別說自己不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"槐琥，用不著這麼咄咄逼人的，她們應該也只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。但是這種事件發生的次數實在是多到幽默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不把其他人捲進去也就罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"殃及無辜，讓平民蒙受財產損失，你們自己就沒有作為合法公民的自覺嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"（好像完全無法反駁！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，有必要糾正你們的劣根性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"用、用不著直接拉開拳架吧，我們也知道今晚給大家添了很多麻煩，但是有話好好說嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"——好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"話說在前頭，今晚的事情，對我而言，同樣莫名其妙，而且，很累。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我現在的心情實在不怎麼好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"你明白嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"一對一，我贏了，你們接下來就得乖乖遵紀守法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"......至少一個月。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"（一個月就夠了！？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"我贏了，就讓你們那些成天不務正業的傢伙多管好自己的工作，少管閒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"這說的倒是沒錯......但是，我是不會手下留情的！準備好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，怎麼就變成這樣了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！都冷靜一下！再怎麼說，在市中心打架鬥毆也有點太——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好功夫，打得好！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"狼小姐也不要輸啊！打！小心背後！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好久沒見過這麼漂亮的炎國功夫了！多耍幾招啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是表演啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"德克薩斯！加油！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"小心腳下！是佯攻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"你們也不要跟著起哄啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"汽水，你們要嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！謝謝。但是你不打算稍微勸個架嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"阻止不了，看樣子也知道吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們就這麼看著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"不然加加油也可以？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"*雜音*——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂——！所有參加安魂夜派對的好市民們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"搞什麼，那個傢伙是怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"聽得見嗎~？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你很吵欸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不錯不錯，看來聽得見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那麼現在，請靜一靜！靜一靜！謝謝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廣播","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"然後豎起耳朵，膜拜我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那、那傢伙怎麼回事！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，他是大帝！喂，是塞壬的饒舌之神！快來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他不是應該在哥倫比亞嗎！？怎麼會在龍門？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"......大帝先生，在幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆總自詡是音樂人嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"實際上也是喔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"咱們的資金來源當然不光是物流業務本身，老闆的資金管道非常複雜。還有——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"還有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"不，還是算了。感覺說太多會很不妙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，動作變慢了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"......人流的動向太整齊了，情況不對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"別想找藉口！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大帝！大帝！大帝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大帝！大帝！大帝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......真吵啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"今天是安魂節，大帝先生，你的噪音連死人都能吵醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"什——！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"你是，什麼時候......在我身後......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"晚安，大帝先生，安魂節快樂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"......臭老鼠，你給我......記住......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，怎麼了？這是什麼演出——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大帝？大帝被刺穿了？死了！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"喝啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","isRemote":false,"text":"哼嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒客？","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"哎？槐琥，你打錯人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"不。她沒做錯什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"char_102_texas","isRemote":false,"text":"被包圍的是我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒客？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"char_103_angel","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......難道說，該不會，從貧民窟一直追到了這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡，這麼多人，都是他們的同夥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"char_101_sora","isRemote":false,"text":"不會吧，這個人數......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"基本全都是敵人，這是個陷阱，大帝先生他——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"——！?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac5_5_back"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac5_5_fro"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這個話筒該怎麼用......咳咳，喂？各位龍門市民，晚上好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請各位不要慌張，剛才死掉的只是一隻微不足道的企鵝，安魂夜慶典不會停止。自然，會有專人來處理這具麻煩的屍體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雖然事出突然，深感歉意，不過是時候為今晚的狂歡增添一項臨時項目了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們的敘拉古朋友為我們帶來了一份特別大禮，現在藏在這場露天派對的某個地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"時間不多，朋友們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"char_325_bison","isRemote":false,"text":"（他在看著我？不，等等，那個老人是——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"如果沒有人找到這份寶藏，很遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鼠王","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"那將是你們人生中最後的驚喜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_101_sora","aliases":["空"]},{"speakerId":"char_102_texas","aliases":["德克薩斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_103_angel","aliases":["能天使"]},{"speakerId":"char_105_emper","aliases":["大帝"]},{"speakerId":"char_201_moeshd","aliases":["可頌"]},{"speakerId":"char_243_waaifu","aliases":["槐琥"]},{"speakerId":"char_272_strong","aliases":["孑"]},{"speakerId":"char_325_bison","aliases":["拜松"]}]}
